{"id":"e46a12700e8a8a48","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md","title":"Bounded Forcing Axioms","display":"thm-bounded-forcing-axioms — Bounded Forcing Axioms","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms","aliases":["58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms","Bounded Forcing Axioms","BFA","BPFA"],"display":"thm-bounded-forcing-axioms — Bounded Forcing Axioms","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms</span><span>Bounded Forcing Axioms</span><span>BFA</span><span>BPFA</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bounded-forcing-axioms — Bounded Forcing Axioms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md\">../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb305cc6af2d4262\" href=\"?note=bb305cc6af2d4262\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PFA}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md\">../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md</a> 中定义的一阶句子缩写</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 是 proper 偏序的元层类谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\)</span> 是接受元层类谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有界强迫公理方案（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb305cc6af2d4262\" href=\"?note=bb305cc6af2d4262\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BPFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{BPFA}\\)</span> 是下式定义的 Bounded Proper Forcing Axiom 缩写</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bpfa\\text{-}proper\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bpfa\\text{-}proper\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bpfa}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BPFA}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}},\\omega_1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bpfa}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BPFA}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}},\\omega_1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\to\\mathrm{BPFA}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\to\\mathrm{BPFA}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Goldstern-Shelah: introduced bounded forcing axioms.</li>\n<li>BPFA 可刻画为关于 proper forcing 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(\\omega_2)\">\\(H(\\omega_2)\\)</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 泛型绝对性原则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC} + \\exists \\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Reflecting}(\\kappa))\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC} + \\exists \\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Reflecting}(\\kappa))\\)</span> is equiconsistent with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC} + \\mathrm{BPFA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC} + \\mathrm{BPFA})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Typical consequences recorded in the literature include failures of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>PFA 蕴含 BPFA；两者的常用一致性强度上界分别由更强的大基数假设与反射基数假设校准，不能仅凭蕴含式把所有精确强度比较都写成已证明的严格等号。</li>\n<li>Applications: cardinal arithmetic, stationary sets.</li>\n<li>Connection: reflects proof-theoretic analysis.</li>\n<li>Bounded MA: even weaker version exists.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\)</span> 是真类谓词而非集合；因此本条继承上游有界强迫公理的元层方案类型，不能把它伪装成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 中的集合参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb305cc6af2d4262","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$ 是 [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]] 中定义的一阶句子缩写","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb305cc6af2d4262","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)$ 是接受元层类谓词 $\\Gamma$ 的有界强迫公理方案（see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{prop}}(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BPFA}","display":false},{"tex":"